  {
    "id": "ui_tmpl",
    "type": "template",
    "z": "tab_demo_ctl",
    "name": "trang dieu khien",
    "field": "payload",
    "fieldType": "msg",
    "format": "html",
    "syntax": "plain",
    "template": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"vi\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Hu Tieu — dieu khien demo</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;margin:0;padding:24px;max-width:620px}h1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 4px}p.sub{color:#94a3b8;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px}.card{background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px}button{font-size:16px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer;margin-right:8px}.on{background:#b91c1c;color:#fff}.off{background:#334155;color:#e2e8f0}.k{color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}.v{font-size:22px;font-weight:600}.row{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.warn{background:#422006;border-color:#854d0e;color:#fde68a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}</style></head><body><h1>Dieu khien demo — pack Hu Tieu</h1><p class=\"sub\">Cloud chi XIN, thiet bi QUYET. Moi han muc an toan nam tren ESP32.</p><div class=\"card warn\"><b>Cong tac tu nha sau 15 giay</b> neu trang nay khong gia han. Dong tab hoac mat mang = suoi TAT. Do la co y.</div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"k\">Suoi mot cell de dien</div><div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><button id=\"b\" class=\"off\" onclick=\"tog()\">BAT SUOI</button><button class=\"off\" onclick=\"send('heat_stop')\">DUNG NGAY</button></div><div class=\"row\"><div><div class=\"k\">chenh lech</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"d\">—</div></div><div><div class=\"k\">con hieu luc</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"l\">—</div></div><div><div class=\"k\">trang thai</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"s\" style=\"font-size:15px\">—</div></div></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"k\">Coi</div><div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><button class=\"off\" onclick=\"send('mute',!st.muted)\">TAT/BAT TIENG</button><button class=\"off\" onclick=\"send('quiet',!st.quiet)\">BIP THUA</button></div><div class=\"row\"><div><div class=\"k\">muc bao dong</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"a\">—</div></div><div><div class=\"k\">coi</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"m\" style=\"font-size:15px\">—</div></div></div><div class=\"k\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Bip thua KHONG phai giam am luong — SFM-27 la coi chu dong, chi co keu/khong keu. No rut tieng con mot nhip ngan moi chu ky. Muc NGUY KICH luon keu het co.</div></div><script>\nlet want=false, st={};\nconst L=['OK','THEO DOI','BAO DONG','NGUY KICH'];\nasync function send(c,on){await fetch('/hutieu/cmd',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(on===undefined?{cmd:c}:{cmd:c,on:on})});}\nfunction tog(){want=!want;document.getElementById('b').className=want?'on':'off';document.getElementById('b').textContent=want?'DANG SUOI — bam de dung':'BAT SUOI';if(!want)send('heat_stop');}\n// gia han moi 5s: deadman tren thiet bi la 15s nen mat 3 nhip lien tiep moi tat\nsetInterval(()=>{if(want)send('heat');},5000);\nsetInterval(async()=>{try{const r=await fetch('/hutieu/state');st=await r.json();\ndocument.getElementById('d').textContent=(st.delta!==undefined?st.delta.toFixed(2)+' °C':'—');\ndocument.getElementById('l').textContent=(st.left_s!==undefined?st.left_s+' s':'—');\ndocument.getElementById('s').textContent=st.reason||'—';\ndocument.getElementById('a').textContent=L[st.alarm]||'—';\ndocument.getElementById('m').textContent=st.muted?'DA TAT TIENG':(st.quiet?'bip thua':'keu binh thuong');}catch(e){}},1000);\n</script></body></html>",
